      "body": "### Godot version\n\nv4.0.alpha.custom_build [daa055d47]\n\n### System information\n\nMIUI 13 (Android 12), Poco x3 pro (Adreno 640)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI've been experimenting on making simple text animations, with the animation player making fade in a text work, but using tweens doesn't (at least on my mobile phone), and spams this error (I've selected the part that appears no to repeat):  \r\n\r\n`28.267 22603 22639 E godot   : USER ERROR: Condition \"!pipeline\" is true.\r\n06-30 21:01:28.267 22603 22639 E godot   :    at: draw_list_bind_render_pipeline (drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_vulkan.cpp:7350) - Condition \"!pipeline\" is true.\r\n06-30 21:01:28.267 22603 22639 E godot   : USER ERROR: Condition \"!uniform_set\" is true.\r\n06-30 21:01:28.267 22603 22639 E godot   :    at: draw_list_bind_uniform_set (drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_vulkan.cpp:7425) - Condition \"!uniform_set\" is true.\r\n06-30 21:01:28.267 22603 22639 E godot   : USER ERROR: This render pipeline requires (0) bytes of push constant data, supplied: (64)\r\n06-30 21:01:28.267 22603 22639 E godot   :    at: draw_list_set_push_constant (drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_vulkan.cpp:7533) - Condition \"p_data_size != dl->validation.pipeline_push_constant_size\" is true.\r\n06-30 21:01:28.267 22603 22639 E godot   : USER ERROR: No render pipeline was set before attempting to draw.\r\n06-30 21:01:28.267 22603 22639 E godot   :    at: draw_list_draw (drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_vulkan.cpp:7550) - Condition \"!dl->validation.pipeline_active\" is true.\r\n`\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nJust animate something using tweens\n\n### Minimal reproduction project\n\n[AndroidTweenBug.zip](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/files/9022735/AndroidTweenBug.zip)\r\n",
